ope and REMAP-CAP mis-filed).</span></li><li><strong>ZODIAC</strong> &rarr; sglt2-hfref-hosp-cvdeath: <code>NOT_FOUND</code> <span class='muted'>no identifiable sglt2-HFrEF RCT named ZODIAC; the well-known ZODIAC is the Zwolle OBSERVATIONAL outpatient-diabetes cohort (not an RCT). PubMed search surfaces EMPEROR-Reduced etc., no ZODIAC trial. Likely a 4th test-set error (observational/non-existent RCT). Recorded NOT_FOUND pending an identifier; not eligible as stated.</span></li><li><strong>Toblli 2007</strong> &rarr; iv-iron-hfref-hosp: <code>SCOPE_PENDING</code> <span class='muted'>verified IV iron vs placebo, anemic chronic HF, but PRIMARY is NT-proBNP/CRP + functional parameters, NOT HF hospitalization. Contributes (if at all) to the participant-level strand of the deferred iv-iron 3-strand build, not the hospitalization pool. iv-iron deferred.</span></li><li><strong>IRON-HF</strong> &rarr; iv-iron-hfref-hosp: <code>SCOPE_PENDING</code> <span class='muted'>verified IV iron in anemic HF, small functional trial (peak VO2 class); PRIMARY not HF hospitalization. Deferred to the iv-iron 3-strand build.</span></li><li><strong>STEP 8</strong> &rarr; semaglutide-obesity-weight: <code>SCOPE_PENDING</code> <span class='muted'>verified (DOI 10.1001/jama.2021.23619, NCT04074161): 3-arm sema 2.4 vs liraglutide vs POOLED placebo (n=85), primary sema-vs-liraglutide (open-label). The sema-vs-PLACEBO contrast (-15.8% vs -1.9%) IS present + double-blinded but is a SUPPORTIVE SECONDARY with a pooled placebo, and the abstract gives no per-arm SDs for MD pooling. SCOPE_PENDING (pooled-placebo secondary + full-text SDs needed). Corrects the audit framing that STEP 8 is a plain active-comparator exclusion.</span></li><li><strong>EMPA-VISION</strong> &rarr; empagliflozin-hfpef-hosp: <code>OUT_OF_SCOPE</code> <span class='muted'>empagliflozin cardiac-ENERGETICS trial (31P-MRS phosphocreatine/ATP ratio primary), mechanistic imaging study -- not HF hospitalization. Wrong outcome for empagl