vity'>known-missing sensitivity panel</a>.<ul><li>no genuine executed concept search (PMID_ENUMERATION_explicit): search.retrieval.enumeration_only=true; no discovery-capable concept source ran</li><li>a trial identified as eligible under the registered PICO is not pooled (FLOW, FREEDOM-CVO) — the pooled result and completeness claim cannot be current</li><li>screened-in (decision=include) but not pooled in any outcome — eligible trials the pool does not contain: NCT01147250; the completeness claim cannot be current</li></ul></div><p class='muted'><strong>Identifier scope:</strong> identifier leading token matches class term GLP-1RA. Verdict: <code>NOT_APPLICABLE</code>.</p><div class='absent'><strong>KNOWN-ITEM RETRIEVAL — NOT A SYSTEMATIC SEARCH</strong> We retract any claim of a registry-first or systematic search for this topic. an auditable screening ledger attached to an unauditable retrieval process. 4 PMID-enumeration queries; 0 title/name-seeded queries; 0 free-text keyword queries.</div><div class='scope-identity'><strong>Scope identity mismatch.</strong> Eligibility is open P/I/C/design, but retrieval is a pre-identified set. eligibility over the open scope was NOT tested (search class KNOWN_ITEM_RETRIEVAL).</div><p>9 of the pre-identified set met eligibility; eligibility over the open scope was NOT tested (search class KNOWN_ITEM_RETRIEVAL).</p><h3>Primary outcome</h3><table class='kv'><tr><th>Outcome</th><td>3-point major adverse cardiovascular events</td></tr><tr><th>Estimand</th><td>HR</td></tr><tr><th>Estimand decision</th><td>time_to_first_event: prefer published HR; keep reconstruction only when no HR exists Target scale HR; declared HR.</td></tr><tr><th>Trials pooled (k)</th><td>8 — 31185157 (PMID 31185157); 27633186 (PMID 27633186); 27295427 (PMID 27295427); 34215025 (PMID 34215025); 31189511 (PMID 31189511); 30291013 (PMID 30291013); 28910237 (PMID 28910237); SOUL (PMID 40162642)</td></tr><tr><th>Screened-in → pooled</th><td>9 of the pre-identified set met eligibility; eligibility over the open scope was NOT tested (search class KNOWN_ITEM_RETRIEVAL); 8 reported this outcome with an extractable number and were pooled; the remaining 1 trial family are listed as declared-absent in Results (they were included but reported no poolable value for this outcome).</td></tr><tr><th>Pooled effect</th><td>0.86 (HR), 95% CI 0.81–0.91</td></tr><tr><th>Prediction interval</th><td>0.81–0.91 STALE: pooled membership known incomplete (3 eligible families not in the pool); tau^2, I^2 and the prediction interval are descriptive only, not interpretable.</td></tr><tr><th>Between-study τ²</th><td>4e-05 (non-zero; not 0) STALE: pooled membership known incomplete (3 eligible families not in the pool); tau^2, I^2 and the prediction interval are descriptive only, not interpretable.</td></tr><tr><th>Heterogeneity state</th><td>STALE: pooled membership known incomplete (3 eligible families not in the pool); tau^2, I^2 and the prediction interval are descriptive only, not interpretable.</td></tr><tr><th>Method</th><td>Random-effects inverse-variance on the log ratio (log RR/OR/HR/IRR as configured for the outcome); Paule-Mandel tau^2; HKSJ 95% CI on t_{k-1} (variance floor max(1,Q/(k-1))); prediction interval mu +/- t_{k-1}*sqrt(tau2+se^2). Validated vs metafor 5.0.1 (this canonical code path; every rendered interval is gate-checked to originate here).</td></tr></table><div class='kms-panel' id='known-missing-sensitivity'><h3>Known eligible trials not in this pool, and what they would do</h3><p><strong>Panel conclusion effect: NOT_COMPUTABLE.</strong> These rows are SENSITIVITY only; they do not replace the primary pool.</p><p class='note'>Endpoint components: <code>CV_DEATH | NONFATAL_MI | NONFATAL_STROKE</code></p><table class='arms'><tr><th>Trial</th><th>Value status</th><th>Debt class</th><th>Why eligible</th><th>Committed value/span</th><th>Sensitivity</th><th>Conclusion effect</th></tr><tr><td>FLOW</td><td>NOT_IN_COMMITTED_SOURCE