et (CV_DEATH, NONFATAL_MI, NONFATAL_STROKE); registered &#x27;Primary Efficacy Outcome MACE Events&#x27;'>low</td></tr><tr><td>30291013</td><td><strong>low (on assessed domains; some domains require human judgement)</strong></td><td title='AACT allocation = RANDOMIZED'>low</td><td title='trial masking = Quadruple (blinded): participants/personnel blinded'>low</td><td title='not assessed - AACT flow shows between-arm differential attrition 0.9% (overall 2.8%), but study discontinuation is NOT outcome missingness and outcome-dependence needs human reading; the attrition figures are context, not a risk-of-bias rating'>not assessed</td><td title='trial masking = Quadruple (blinded): outcome assessment blinded'>low</td><td title='the pooled outcome matches the trial&#x27;s pre-registered primary outcome by component set (CV_DEATH, NONFATAL_MI, NONFATAL_STROKE); registered &#x27;Time to First Occurrence of Major Adverse Cardiovascular Events (MACE) During Cardiovascular (CV) Follow-up Time Period&#x27;'>low</td></tr><tr><td>31185157</td><td><strong>low (on assessed domains; some domains require human judgement)</strong></td><td title='AACT allocation = RANDOMIZED'>low</td><td title='trial masking = Double (blinded); overrides per-role Booleans subject_masked=True/caregiver_masked=False (FLAGGED registry-vs-trial disagreement)'>low</td><td title='not assessed - AACT flow shows between-arm differential attrition 0.1% (overall 0.3%), but study discontinuation is NOT outcome missingness and outcome-dependence needs human reading; the attrition figures are context, not a risk-of-bias rating'>not assessed</td><td title='trial masking = Double (blinded); overrides outcomes_assessor_masked=False (FLAGGED registry-vs-trial disagreement)'>low</td><td title='the pooled outcome matches the trial&#x27;s pre-registered primary outcome by component set (CV_DEATH, NONFATAL_MI, NONFATAL_STROKE); registered &#x27;Time From Randomisation to First Occurrence of a Major Adverse Cardiovascular